00:24:25.163 --> 00:24:27.163
un makhn ordenung

00:24:27.163 --> 00:24:29.273
un s'iz ibergegangen

00:24:29.273 --> 00:24:31.763
der shvung. m'hot arestirt di CUZISTN

00:24:31.763 --> 00:24:34.605
un m'hot, di organizatsye

00:24:34.605 --> 00:24:35.859
⟨disfintsirt⟩.

00:24:36.557 --> 00:24:38.272
iz gevorn gringer

00:24:38.346 --> 00:24:40.601
un damolst bin ikh gegangen in der armey.

00:24:40.759 --> 00:24:42.457
in velkhe yor iz dos?

00:24:42.430 --> 00:24:46.920
in akht un draysikstn, in end- in akht un draysi- ⟨onheybndik⟩ nayn un draysik.

00:24:46.041 --> 00:24:48.279
vi lang zent ir geven in der armey?

00:24:47.813 --> 00:24:50.372
in der armey bin ikh geven kimat dray yor.

00:24:51.407 --> 00:24:57.003
ikh hob gedint, ikh hob gedint in, in der shtot Rumenye in IASI, Yash.

00:24:51.437 --> 00:24:53.597
vu zent ir geven?

00:24:57.567 --> 00:25:02.467
in ANTIAERIANE. dos meynt az dos iz gevezn aza UNIT vos er hot gedarft

00:25:02.467 --> 00:25:05.567
aropshisn di es- di

00:25:05.567 --> 00:25:08.951
 AIRPLANES fun dem soyne.

00:25:09.953 --> 00:25:13.778
dos iz ah geven a n- a naye

00:25:13.778 --> 00:25:18.168
r- UNIT vos m'hot, andere hobn gedint a yor mit akht khadoshim

00:25:18.168 --> 00:25:22.440
un ikh hob gedarft dinen dray, dray yor. dos iz gevezn a zeyer a shverer

00:25:22.440 --> 00:25:24.929
militer dinst

00:25:24.929 --> 00:25:28.659
in GOROD- in IASI. shpeter hot mikh ibergefirt keyn Bukarest

00:25:28.659 --> 00:25:31.490
ober zeyer veynik gevezn in Bukarest un tsurikgeshikt.

00:25:31.490 --> 00:25:33.251
oyf kursn keyn Bukarest.

00:25:32.886 --> 00:25:35.765
vu zent geven ayere eltern in dem tsayt?

00:25:35.299 --> 00:25:37.858
mayne eltern zenen geven in Yedinits

00:25:37.881 --> 00:25:40.052
in, in Besarabye

00:25:41.273 --> 00:25:43.072
un mayn bruder

00:25:43.230 --> 00:25:45.842
der elterer brider iz geven in Britsheve

00:25:45.842 --> 00:25:50.767
un mayn, der kleyner bruder BORIS iz gevezn in Sekuran.

00:25:51.938 --> 00:25:53.856
zenen zey geven in der armey oykhet?

00:25:53.625 --> 00:25:55.610
zey zenen gevezn in der armey.

00:25:55.650 --> 00:25:59.339
zey zenen, hobn gedint in der armey frier, ⟨zikher⟩

00:25:59.380 --> 00:26:02.400
befor s'iz gevorn di CUZISTN.

00:26:02.400 --> 00:26:04.910
damolst iz nokh gevezn gringer a bisl.

00:26:04.910 --> 00:26:07.410
mayn elterer bruder hot gedint tsvey yor

00:26:07.410 --> 00:26:14.290
un mayn BORIS, der b- bruder, der ts- tsveyter bruder, hot gedungen, hot gedint a yor mit akht monatn.

00:26:14.601 --> 00:26:16.569
un vu zenen di shvester geven?

00:26:16.980 --> 00:26:20.300
di shvester zenen gevezn in Besarabye in Yedinits.

00:26:20.300 --> 00:26:23.330
zey hobn gelernt in der rumenisher SCHOOL

00:26:23.330 --> 00:26:24.972
un hobn gelernt HEBREW.

00:26:26.143 --> 00:26:29.562
HEBREW hobn zey gelernt shoyn privat.

00:26:30.042 --> 00:26:33.883
un ven ir zent geven in armey, hobn zey nokh gekent geyn in SCHOOL?

00:26:34.041 --> 00:26:34.794
yo.

00:26:35.104 --> 00:26:38.138
damolst ven m- ven ikh bin geven in der armey

00:26:38.138 --> 00:26:42.810
mayne tsvey shvesterl zenen zeyer bagabte. zey hobn gehat zeyer sheyne shtimes

00:26:43.086 --> 00:26:45.088
iz dos iz gegangen f-

00:26:45.094 --> 00:26:48.494
loyt azoy me zogt loytn shoyresh fun mayne eltern.

00:26:48.494 --> 00:26:51.884
mayn foter iz geven a bal tfile zeyer mit a sheyne shtim

00:26:51.884 --> 00:26:57.711
un mayn muter iz gevezn a, hot gehat zeyer a sheyne shtim un hot gezungen. a mol hot zi geshpilt in yidishn teater

00:26:57.711 --> 00:26:59.751
un hot genumen anteyl

00:26:59.751 --> 00:27:02.076
SHU- di SHULAMIT

00:27:02.076 --> 00:27:04.109
un dos groyse gevins

00:27:04.109 --> 00:27:09.033
un nokh eynike in MOGILOV PODOLSK un in Belts

00:27:09.343 --> 00:27:12.093
un zi fleg shtendik zitsn oyf der nakht

00:27:12.093 --> 00:27:15.993
ven di, ven di meydlekh flegn arbetn a bisl shpeter in sezon

00:27:15.993 --> 00:27:20.606
fleg zi oysdertseyln di gantse pyeses un di gantse anteyl un oyszingen

00:27:20.606 --> 00:27:23.923
di lider mit dem alem, un mayn foter gedenk ikh hot gezungen

00:27:23.923 --> 00:27:26.033
di lid funem TITANIK

00:27:26.033 --> 00:27:27.936
funem dertrunkenem

00:27:27.936 --> 00:27:31.021
d- TITANIK vos iz ⟨umgekumen⟩ di ershte

00:27:31.146 --> 00:27:33.496
di englishe groyse shif

00:27:33.496 --> 00:27:35.425
mit a sakh yidishe

00:27:35.425 --> 00:27:37.875
pasazhirn

00:27:37.875 --> 00:27:40.466
iz geven a sh- a, Yosl ROSENBLATT

00:27:40.466 --> 00:27:42.674
olevasholem hot gezungen nokh dem

00:27:42.674 --> 00:27:45.454
di, di dozike, fleg er dos oyszingen.

00:27:45.456 --> 00:27:46.836
nokh andere lider.

00:27:46.836 --> 00:27:49.030
iz mayne kinde- shvesterlekh

00:27:49.030 --> 00:27:52.605
s- Yentele hot gehat a ULTRALIRIK SOPRANO

00:27:53.117 --> 00:27:55.420
azoy vi a f- a fidele.

00:27:55.420 --> 00:27:56.838
mayn

00:27:56.838 --> 00:28:02.738
mayn UNK Malkele UNK Manyele azoy m'hot zi gerufn, hot gehat a ALTO, flegn zey zingen DUET.

00:28:03.411 --> 00:28:06.892
vos zenen zey gegangen in di rumenishe SCHOOL azoy fray?

00:28:06.892 --> 00:28:10.846
der LUCANIUC, ot der vos er hot mir arayngeshtelt a shtekn in haldz

00:28:10.937 --> 00:28:14.657
a antisemit, iz gekumen shpeter betn bay mayn tatn

00:28:14.657 --> 00:28:18.047
in, a untershrift az di kinder zoln geyn tsun im in SCHOOL

00:28:20.387 --> 00:28:23.340
az zey zoln zingen bay im in CHOIR.
